    ],
    "summary": "V1 Record Outcome",
    "description": "Record whether the case breached after an intervention (admin key required). Outcomes on holdout rows are what\nturn the assumed effects into measured uplift; until some exist, /v1/interventions/roi reports only simulated results.",
